classDiagram
    direction LR

    class Atlas {
        -ICostPolicy costPolicy
        -bool keepLastEdge
        +longestPath(graph, startLabel) list
        +dfs(graph, startEdge, marked, stack)
        +bestExtension(graph, currentStart, coverCount) list
        +getTestSuite(graph, path) string
        +run(graph) string
        +coverage(graph, path)$
        +isContinuous(graph, path)$
    }

    class Graph {
        -table nodes
        -table edges
        -list starts
        -list finishes
        +addVertex(node)
        +addEdge(label, source, destination, input, output, weight, required, data) Edge
        +getEdge(label) Edge
        +getEdgeLabels() list
        +edgeLabels(node) list
        +getEdgeCount() int
        +getNodes() list
        +getStarts() list
        +addStart(label)
        +getFinishes() list
        +addFinish(label)
        +getRequiredEdgeCount() int
        +sortAdjacency(comparator)
    }

    class Edge {
        +int label
        +source
        +destination
        +input
        +output
        +number weight
        +bool required
        +data
        +getLabel() int
        +isSelfLoop() bool
    }

    class ICostPolicy {
        <<interface>>
        +initial() cost
        +extend(cost, edge, isNew) cost
        +isBetter(a, b) bool
        +hasGain(cost) bool
    }

    class UnitCostPolicy {
        <<Strategy>>
        +initial() number
        +extend(cost, edge, isNew) number
        +isBetter(a, b) bool
        +hasGain(cost) bool
    }

    class DistanceAwareCostPolicy {
        <<Strategy>>
        +number SCALE
        +initial() number
        +extend(cost, edge, isNew) number
        +isBetter(a, b) bool
        +hasGain(cost) bool
        +unpack(cost)$
    }

    class CostPolicyFactory {
        <<Factory Method>>
        -table creators
        +create(name)$
    }

    Atlas --> ICostPolicy : maliyet hesabı
    Atlas ..> Graph : üzerinde yürür
    Graph "1" *-- "many" Edge : içerir
    ICostPolicy <|.. UnitCostPolicy
    ICostPolicy <|.. DistanceAwareCostPolicy
    CostPolicyFactory ..> ICostPolicy : oluşturur

    note for Atlas "Hocanın Java ATLAS kodunun Lua portu.\nkeepLastEdge=false: Java ile birebir aynı çıktı.\nkeepLastEdge=true: son kenar düşmez (tüm kenarlar kapsanır)."
    note for UnitCostPolicy "Orijinal ATLAS maliyeti:\nyeni kenar sayısı"
    note for DistanceAwareCostPolicy "Aynı kapsama -> daha kısa mesafe.\nTek sayıda saklanır (tablo yok, hızlı)."
